OL,3,CMan charged in connection with bomb
OL,4,Cseized near Northern Ireland border
OL,6,FPolice investigating a suspected
OL,7,Fdissident republican bomb, intercepted
OL,8,Fin a car near the Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fborder, have charged a man in his 40s
OL,10,Fin connection with the case.
OL,12,FThe man is due to appear before the
OL,13,FSpecial Criminal Court at the Criminal
OL,14,FCourts of Justice in Dublin at 9pm on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FA vehicle travelling on the N2 near
OL,18,FCarrickmacross, Co Monaghan, on
OL,19,FWednesday afternoon was stopped and
OL,20,Fsearched by detectives in an
OL,21,Fintelligence-led swoop.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/3
