OL,3,CMan charged in connection with bomb
OL,4,Cseized near Northern Ireland border
OL,6,FA 25-year-old law student appeared
OL,7,Fbefore a district court on Friday
OL,8,Fevening charged with possession of
OL,9,Fexplosives.
OL,11,FIsobella Perrie Sullivan, of
OL,12,FAbbeylands Park in Clane, Co Kildare,
OL,13,Fwas stopped on the N2, where a bag was
OL,14,Fdiscovered in the back of her car
OL,15,Fcontaining Semtex and a detonator,
OL,16,FTrim District Court heard.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
