CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785020583
OL,3,CMan charged in connection with bomb
OL,4,Cseized near Northern Ireland border
OL,6,FHer solicitor Gavin Booth said she had
OL,7,Fbeen asked to take a bag to the north,
OL,8,Fand had not been aware what was in it.
OL,10,FPerrie Sullivan was granted bail but
OL,11,Fremains in custody ahead of a further
OL,12,Fbail hearing on Monday.
OL,14,FThe bail conditions include a 15,000-
OL,15,Feuro independent surety, that she
OL,16,Fsurrenders her passport, that she
OL,17,Fstays at an address approved by gardai
OL,18,Fwith a curfew of 9pm to 7am, that she
OL,19,Fhas a mobile phone available 24/7 and
OL,20,Fthat she signs in each day at Naas
OL,21,FGarda Station.
